        "curse",
        "mental",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements The weredigo is adjacent to two creatures that can't decide where to get brunch.\n\n---\n\nEffect The weredigo makes two fork Strikes and two knife Strikes against one of the adjacent creatures. These attacks don't count toward the weredigo's multiple attack penalty."
    },
